ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pa3Uci93dxsQ7kNvwELOsRS&_nc_oc=AdmspXPzVUmoEVtiagq4BjgcZg2RWDw5B1JNoYvk8rIL7EzNLXIGJ7Vz8pJSIkqBH7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxtNDGM1ynOGh8VhmnV5H45wI8dZzPAYW5XZ3Zbsdak8A&oe=69AD5B01"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7-HMi3-ZigAQ7kNvwHdg7lN&_nc_oc=Adm2Nze3omDXq3FxlUvn-4vNZPt_G_5fXGD-mvRD-x841Uu8Jiny83ptsrEsMo4po-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwKcU_Oq4Jd2x-Wp3Kdy5dZ7_lSU9sHu84OTtc0kM3O1A&oe=69AD6866"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5knUFRrOhEQ7kNvwHcoHP7&_nc_oc=AdkpgwdAHcVe_k9TeZMZXAhvwlY4qqZATKP5WMxO_qR_8qT_nvuB-v8w3b3eYuG7kr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss